{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>經典法式牛扒+香橙酒薄餅梳乎厘</p><p>啟德新開法式小酒館</p><p>啟德新開一間法式小酒館，以典雅的酒紅條紋牆面、手繪壁畫與亮面紅桌，好適合節日慶祝。餐廳主打一系列經典的法式美饌，招牌菜式包括經慢火溫燉的紅酒燴牛肉、法式牛扒配薯條、Suzette香橙酒薄餅梳乎厘等，將巴黎的生活風格帶進社區。</p><p>主菜推介法式牛扒配薯條！</p><p>主菜推介紅酒燴牛肉經慢火溫燉，肉質柔嫩、入口即融；法式牛扒配薯條配搭風味鮮明濃郁的黑椒汁，呈現最地道的法式風味；油封鴨腿配扁豆表皮金黃香脆，下層鋪滿吸飽肉汁的扁豆，層次豐富。</p><p>招牌Suzette香橙酒薄餅梳乎厘</p><p>由自家烘焙坊每日新鮮製作的法式甜品亦不容錯過。當中包括招牌甜點Suzette香橙酒薄餅梳乎厘，將蓬鬆的梳乎厘包裹於薄餅之中，淋上香橙醬及香橙甜酒，香氣四溢；仲有法式蘋果薄批及焦糖燉蛋。</p><p>Bistrot’s Suzette 地址：九龍城啟德協調道10號天璽・天Mall G樓G02號舖�電話： 3188 8896 營業時間：星期一至日：中午12時至晚上10時 官方IG：@bistrots_suzettehk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178746484576530979_8239133646a8a8c904d450.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178746485082865078_531268426a8a8c93a0b11.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178746485373065717_11369149906a8a8c9949ee6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178746485962271498_20429139566a8a8c9ca3eaa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178746486264492000_4525275326a8a8c9f4b4e0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178746486482534070_12238165576a8a8ca1b4ee7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17874648677816102_7254948406a8a8ca48722b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178746487016771382_9092259476a8a8ca763d57.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T06:18:14.155809+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":536,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}